{"id":"1c0b1d31927046ab","group":"72","path":"72/72-df-structured-tree-ordinal.md","title":"结构化树序数","display":"df-structured-tree-ordinal — 结构化树序数","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-df-structured-tree-ordinal","aliases":["72-df-structured-tree-ordinal"],"display":"df-structured-tree-ordinal — 结构化树序数","chapter":"III","depends_on":["[[72-df-tree-ordinal]]","[[72-df-tree-ordinal-predecessor]]"],"source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998","source_location":"Ch.III Def.2.7; print154; PDF166","verification_status":"source-definition-checked","source_statement_status":"checked-against-book","proof_status":"definition-well-defined","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-df-structured-tree-ordinal"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-df-structured-tree-ordinal</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-structured-tree-ordinal — 结构化树序数"},{"key":"chapter","html":"III"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"2e4aa3df9477aa6f\" href=\"?note=2e4aa3df9477aa6f\" title=\"72-df-tree-ordinal\">72-df-tree-ordinal</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"1b42c29cdcade905\" href=\"?note=1b42c29cdcade905\" title=\"72-df-tree-ordinal-predecessor\">72-df-tree-ordinal-predecessor</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Ch.III Def.2.7; print154; PDF166"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-definition-checked"},{"key":"source_statement_status","html":"checked-against-book"},{"key":"proof_status","html":"definition-well-defined"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>树序数编码及严格子树关系见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"2e4aa3df9477aa6f\" href=\"?note=2e4aa3df9477aa6f\" title=\"72-df-tree-ordinal\">72-df-tree-ordinal</a>，有限前驱集见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"1b42c29cdcade905\" href=\"?note=1b42c29cdcade905\" title=\"72-df-tree-ordinal-predecessor\">72-df-tree-ordinal-predecessor</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha,\\beta,\\lambda\\in\\Omega\">\\(\\alpha,\\beta,\\lambda\\in\\Omega\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lambda\\preccurlyeq\\alpha\">\\(\\lambda\\preccurlyeq\\alpha\\)</span> 在下式定义，不与序列初段关系混用。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\beta\\preccurlyeq\\alpha\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ (\\beta=\\alpha\\lor\\beta\\prec\\alpha).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\beta\\preccurlyeq\\alpha\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ (\\beta=\\alpha\\lor\\beta\\prec\\alpha).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Omega_s\\coloneqq\\{\\alpha\\in\\Omega:\\forall(\\lambda_i)_{i\\in\\omega}\\in\\Omega^\\omega\\ (\\mathsf L((\\lambda_i)_{i\\in\\omega})\\preccurlyeq\\alpha\\ \\to\\ \\forall n\\in\\omega\\ (\\lambda_n\\in(\\mathsf L((\\lambda_i)_{i\\in\\omega}))[n+1]))\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Omega_s\\coloneqq\\{\\alpha\\in\\Omega:\\forall(\\lambda_i)_{i\\in\\omega}\\in\\Omega^\\omega\\ (\\mathsf L((\\lambda_i)_{i\\in\\omega})\\preccurlyeq\\alpha\\ \\to\\ \\forall n\\in\\omega\\ (\\lambda_n\\in(\\mathsf L((\\lambda_i)_{i\\in\\omega}))[n+1]))\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>来源：第 III 章 Definition 2.7，印刷 p.154 / PDF p.166。条件要求每个形式极限子树的相邻基本序列分支相容，而不是只要求外延序数序列递增。每棵树只有集合多个子树，显示式是分离得到的集合，没有额外递归或代表元选择。本次对印刷 p.154 / PDF p.166 的定义逐项复核；原书紧接定义指出严格子树仍结构化，这也直接由本式对所有极限子树的全称条件和子树关系的传递性推出。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-tree-ordinal","status":"resolved","id":"2e4aa3df9477aa6f","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-tree-ordinal]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-tree-ordinal-predecessor","status":"resolved","id":"1b42c29cdcade905","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-tree-ordinal-predecessor]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-tree-ordinal","status":"resolved","id":"2e4aa3df9477aa6f","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"树序数编码及严格子树关系见 [[72-df-tree-ordinal]]，有限前驱集见 [[72-df-tree-ordinal-predecessor]]。","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-tree-ordinal-predecessor","status":"resolved","id":"1b42c29cdcade905","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"树序数编码及严格子树关系见 [[72-df-tree-ordinal]]，有限前驱集见 [[72-df-tree-ordinal-predecessor]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\alpha,\\beta,\\lambda\\in\\Omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\lambda\\preccurlyeq\\alpha","display":false},{"tex":"\\beta\\preccurlyeq\\alpha\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ (\\beta=\\alpha\\lor\\beta\\prec\\alpha).","display":true},{"tex":"\\Omega_s\\coloneqq\\{\\alpha\\in\\Omega:\\forall(\\lambda_i)_{i\\in\\omega}\\in\\Omega^\\omega\\ (\\mathsf L((\\lambda_i)_{i\\in\\omega})\\preccurlyeq\\alpha\\ \\to\\ \\forall n\\in\\omega\\ (\\lambda_n\\in(\\mathsf L((\\lambda_i)_{i\\in\\omega}))[n+1]))\\}.","display":true}],"bytes":1778,"backlinks":[{"id":"00439897fba390aa","anchor":"ref-129","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[72-df-structured-tree-ordinal|df-structured-tree-ordinal — 结构化树序数]]"},{"id":"4d85a6a31705a214","anchor":"ref-129","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[./72-df-structured-tree-ordinal|df-structured-tree-ordinal — 结构化树序数]]"},{"id":"c2a9f766f12bca93","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\Omega,\\Omega_s,\\prec,\\alpha[n]$ 见 [[72-df-structured-tree-ordinal]]；有限前驱链性质见 [[72-lem-tree-predecessor-chain]]。$\\alpha\\in\\Omega_s$，$n\\in\\omega$。"}],"outgoing":["2e4aa3df9477aa6f","1b42c29cdcade905"]}